InnerApply<p0 a0 a1 a2>(Input<t0>,Filter<p1 a3 a4>(Input<t1>))|InnerJoin<p2 a5 a6>(Input<t2>,Input<t3>)|t2 := t0;t3 := t1;p2 := And(p0,p1);AttrsUnion(a5,a0,a4);AttrsUnion(a6,a1,a3);AttrsEq(a2,a4);AttrsSub(a0,t0);AttrsSub(a1,t1);AttrsSub(a3,t1);AttrsSub(a4,t0);Deterministic(p0);Deterministic(p1);Deterministic(p2);ErrorFree(p0);ErrorFree(p1);ErrorFree(p2)

